      // ---- Marketplace: PEER game sharing (member-owned, not the club's library) -----------------
      // Three states seeded so every part of the peer flow has something real to show: one the demo
      // member OWNS and can manage, one on loan with a queue, one with a request awaiting the owner.
      {
        // Owner is the bare `tabletop-member` role, so THIS demo session (acting as the member) is the
        // owner and can actually approve/decline/delist it — the one fully demo-actionable owner flow.
        // (Per-individual identity is the noted platform gap; see the type header.)
        "instanceId": "share-ticket-to-ride",
